<p id="p1.1" class="ltx_p ltx_align_center">Equal contribution: Letian Zhu, Han Li, and Yifan Yao.</p>
<p id="p1.2" class="ltx_p ltx_align_center">Corresponding author: Jiaheng Liu at <a href="mailto:liujiaheng@nju.edu.cn" title="" class="ltx_ref ltx_href"><span class="ltx_ref ltx_nolink">liujiaheng@nju.edu.cn</span></a></p>
<p id="p1.3" class="ltx_p ltx_align_center">Code: <a href="https://github.com/NJU-LINK/Socratic-Skill-Learning" title="" class="ltx_ref ltx_url ltx_font_typewriter">https://github.com/NJU-LINK/Socratic-Skill-Learning</a></p>
