<section id="Sx2" class="ltx_section">
<h2 class="ltx_title ltx_title_section">AI Use Statement</h2>

<div id="Sx2.p1" class="ltx_para">
<p id="Sx2.p1.1" class="ltx_p">We used generative AI tools to assist with drafting and adapting benchmark
materials, implementing experimental code and analysis scripts, and
analyzing recorded experimental results. We also used these tools for
literature search, manuscript editing, and figure preparation. Benchmark
materials were developed with human experts in coding and agent benchmarking.
Each case underwent programmatic checks and review by an expert other than
its author, following Appendix <a href="#A2" title="Appendix B Benchmark Assets and Evaluation Cohorts ‣ Socratic Skill Learning: Interleaving Teaching and Practice for Transferable Agent Skills" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">B</span></a>. Numerical summaries were
checked against recorded runs and analysis outputs. The authors take
responsibility for the final content.</p>
</div>
