anchor per family, from the main held-out cohort. A dash denotes a family
outside that cohort. Table <a href="#A2.T6" title="Table 6 ‣ B.4 Evaluation cohort ‣ Appendix B Benchmark Assets and Evaluation Cohorts ‣ Socratic Skill Learning: Interleaving Teaching and Practice for Transferable Agent Skills" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">6</span></a> lists the public variation
axes for the evaluated families. The catalog contains 35 anchors and
373 non-anchor cases, with 5–17 cases per family; family
members are complete executable tasks.</p>
</div>
