<section id="A3.SS3.SSS1" class="ltx_subsubsection">
<h4 class="ltx_title ltx_title_subsubsection"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_subsubsection">C.3.1 </span>Adapted SKILL-KD</h4>

<section id="A3.SS3.SSS1.Px1" class="ltx_paragraph">
<h5 class="ltx_title ltx_title_paragraph">Adaptation.</h5>

<div id="A3.SS3.SSS1.Px1.p1" class="ltx_para">
<p id="A3.SS3.SSS1.Px1.p1.1" class="ltx_p">We use the released <span id="A3.SS3.SSS1.Px1.p1.1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_smallcaps">SKILL-KD</span> loop <cite class="ltx_cite ltx_citemacro_citep">(<a href="#bib.bib21" title="" class="ltx_ref">Shi et al., 2026</a>)</cite><span id="footnote3" class="ltx_note ltx_role_footnote"><sup class="ltx_note_mark">3</sup><span class="ltx_note_outer"><span class="ltx_note_content"><sup class="ltx_note_mark">3</sup>
                  <span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_note">3</span>
                  
                  
                  
                <a href="https://github.com/KhanCold/SKILL-KD" title="" class="ltx_ref ltx_url ltx_font_typewriter">https://github.com/KhanCold/SKILL-KD</a></span></span></span>
at upstream revision
<span id="A3.SS3.SSS1.Px1.p1.1.2" class="ltx_text ltx_font_typewriter">f76b51c3e855</span>, with adapter revision <span id="A3.SS3.SSS1.Px1.p1.1.3" class="ltx_text ltx_font_typewriter">54954317354d</span>; full hashes are
retained in the compact evidence. Each of 66 independent runs starts
from a generic rule seed and makes three visits to its public anchor. A
successful Student attempt leaves the rules unchanged. Otherwise, Teacher and
Student trajectories inform a critic’s proposed rule edits, accepted only after
a fully successful fresh Student rerun. Each visit permits at most three
adaptive rounds; failed candidates roll back to the visit-start rules.
Qwen3.7 Plus is the Student and held-out solver; Max is Teacher and critic.
Every execution uses a fresh session. Only accepted rules, not private edit
history, enter the frozen Skill.</p>
</div>
</section>
<section id="A3.SS3.SSS1.Px2" class="ltx_paragraph">
<h5 class="ltx_title ltx_title_paragraph">Separate cost scope.</h5>

<div id="A3.SS3.SSS1.Px2.p1" class="ltx_para">
<p id="A3.SS3.SSS1.Px2.p1.1" class="ltx_p">The physical-usage audit records 128.11M acquisition
tokens across 66 runs (1.94M per run). The
acquisition-cost columns show a dash for this baseline, since the audit
follows a different scope.</p>
</div>
</section>
</section>
</section>
<section id="A3.SS4" class="ltx_subsection">
<h3 class="ltx_title ltx_title_subsection"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_subsection">C.4 </span>Reproduction</h3>

<div id="A3.SS4.p1" class="ltx_para">
<p id="A3.SS4.p1.1" class="ltx_p">The released repository contains tasks in <span class="ltx_ref ltx_nolink ltx_path ltx_font_typewriter ltx_ref_self">benchmark/</span>, the
execution harness in <span class="ltx_ref ltx_nolink ltx_path ltx_font_typewriter ltx_ref_self">src/</span>, and experiment records in <span class="ltx_ref ltx_nolink ltx_path ltx_font_typewriter ltx_ref_self">experiments/</span>.
The file <span class="ltx_ref ltx_nolink ltx_path ltx_font_typewriter ltx_ref_self">configs/scopes/main.yaml</span> selects the
22-family, 155-case main cohort, and
<span class="ltx_ref ltx_nolink ltx_path ltx_font_typewriter ltx_ref_self">configs/scopes/lite.yaml</span> selects the shared 10-family subset.
Model pairs are specified in <span class="ltx_ref ltx_nolink ltx_path ltx_font_typewriter ltx_ref_self">configs/models/</span>.
Method identifiers match the paper names: <span id="A3.SS4.p1.1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_typewriter">expert-authoring</span>,
<span id="A3.SS4.p1.1.2" class="ltx_text ltx_font_typewriter">post-hoc-teaching</span>, <span id="A3.SS4.p1.1.3" class="ltx_text ltx_font_typewriter">fixed-window-ssl</span>, and
<span id="A3.SS4.p1.1.4" class="ltx_text ltx_font_typewriter">issue-guided-ssl</span>.</p>
</div>
<div id="A3.SS4.p2" class="ltx_para">
<p id="A3.SS4.p2.1" class="ltx_p">With Node.js 22.19 or later and Docker, run the following commands from the
repository root. Configure <span id="A3.SS4.p2.1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_typewriter">SSL_URL</span> and <span id="A3.SS4.p2.1.2" class="ltx_text ltx_font_typewriter">SSL_KEY</span> in
<span class="ltx_ref ltx_nolink ltx_path ltx_font_typewriter ltx_ref_self">.env</span> before acquisition or evaluation:</p>
</div>
<div id="A3.SS4.p3" class="ltx_para ltx_noindent">
<div id="A3.SS4.p3.1" class="ltx_block ltx_minipage ltx_align_middle" style="width:345.0pt;"><pre id="A3.SS4.p3.1.1" class="ltx_verbatim ltx_font_typewriter" style="font-size:90%;">
npm ci
cp .env.example .env
npm run ssl -- run --scope main --model qwen \
  --methods fixed-window-ssl,issue-guided-ssl
npm run ssl -- evaluate --scope main --model qwen \
  --methods fixed-window-ssl,issue-guided-ssl \
  --frozen experiments/main/qwen
</pre>
</div>
</div>
<div id="A3.SS4.p4" class="ltx_para">
<p id="A3.SS4.p4.1" class="ltx_p">Add <span id="A3.SS4.p4.1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_typewriter">--dry-run</span> to inspect a run plan, or use <span id="A3.SS4.p4.1.2" class="ltx_text ltx_font_typewriter">acquire</span> and
<span id="A3.SS4.p4.1.3" class="ltx_text ltx_font_typewriter">evaluate</span> as separate stages. <span class="ltx_ref ltx_nolink ltx_path ltx_font_typewriter ltx_ref_self">docs/running.md</span> documents the
<span id="A3.SS4.p4.1.4" class="ltx_text ltx_font_typewriter">trace2skill</span> and <span id="A3.SS4.p4.1.5" class="ltx_text ltx_font_typewriter">skill-kd</span> baseline commands and setup.
<span class="ltx_ref ltx_nolink ltx_path ltx_font_typewriter ltx_ref_self">experiments/README.md</span> maps cohorts to teaching sessions, Skill packages,
and evaluation records. Scores and frozen Skills are directly available;
<span id="A3.SS4.p4.1.6" class="ltx_text ltx_font_typewriter">python3 scripts/unpack-experiments.py --group main-qwen</span> restores
the remaining Qwen session logs. Acquisition uses only the
anchor and public family specification; held-out evaluation uses fresh
solver sessions with the resulting package.</p>
</div>
</section>
</section>
