16.9% (6.89M to 5.72M per run).
Teaching efficiency is 2.75 times that of
<span id="A6.SS1.p2.1.3" class="ltx_text ltx_font_smallcaps">Fixed-Window SSL</span> at <math id="A6.SS1.p2.m2" class="ltx_Math" alttext="g=10" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mi>g</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>10</mn></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">g=10</annotation></semantics></math>.
The fixed <math id="A6.SS1.p2.m3" class="ltx_Math" alttext="g=5" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mi>g</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>5</mn></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">g=5</annotation></semantics></math> and <math id="A6.SS1.p2.m4" class="ltx_Math" alttext="g=20" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mi>g</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>20</mn></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">g=20</annotation></semantics></math> schedules reach 0.776 and
0.776, respectively.</p>
</div>
