<div id="A6.SS1.p5" class="ltx_para">
<p id="A6.SS1.p5.1" class="ltx_p">On DeepSeek, 52.8M additional Student tokens arise mainly from
more calls (890 to 1,216,
+36.6%), concentrated in the first two rounds.
<span id="A6.SS1.p5.1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_typewriter">sqlite-db-truncate</span> adds 23.8M total acquisition tokens;
the other families save 12.8M, leaving a net increase of
11.0M. The 41.8M Educator saving combines
fewer reviews (195 to 69) with smaller
ones. Fixed-Window SSL has 25 Educator calls re-reading over
500K cached tokens (maximum 799K); its top 15% of calls
consume 35% of Educator tokens. Issue-Guided SSL has
no calls above 500K cached tokens.</p>
</div>
